    "subject": "MILOS - Venetian Plaster / Plaster White Finish",
    "summary": null,
    "chatId": null,
    "importance": "normal",
    "locale": "en-us",
    "webUrl": "https://teams.microsoft.com/l/message/19%3A710d8b6659ff4676a0f0d66de7f42698%40thread.tacv2/1607646143988?groupId=570cfa6a-8cc0-44b9-9059-e427f8c7afc2&tenantId=d8ff7b02-502f-4629-9429-e4735e2ee1aa&createdTime=1607646143988&parentMessageId=1607646143988",
    "policyViolation": null,
    "eventDetail": null,
    "from": {
      "application": null,
      "device": null,
      "user": {
        "@odata.type": "#microsoft.graph.teamworkUserIdentity",
        "id": "4e889aff-70d8-46f1-9a5c-52a4f8e0c2c1",
        "displayName": "Paul Gerrard",
        "userIdentityType": "aadUser",
        "tenantId": "d8ff7b02-502f-4629-9429-e4735e2ee1aa"
      }
    },
    "body": {
      "contentType": "html",
      "content": "<div>\n<div itemprop=\"copy-paste-block\">\n\n<div style=\"font-size:small\"><em>Hello Team- we are working on some new indoor concepts in a white plaster finish. We're looking for a slightly textured, hand applied white plaster finish with a slight texture to it, matte sheen level. Could you see if any of the current&nbsp;vendors would be able to achieve such a finish? (Reference images attached). Typically I've seen this type of finish applied over an MDF or resin substrate, open to whatever works best for the vendor.&nbsp;</em></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"font-size:small\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"font-size:small\"><em>Also attached some of the overall concepts/shapes we are thinking of... please note we are still working on the shapes, this is just for reference to show the type of more sculptural forms we are looking at.</em></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"font-size:small\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"font-size:small\"><em>We'd love to have a vendor start working on some different panel options showing a few different textures/techniques/sheen levels. Let us know your thoughts.</em></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"font-size:small\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"font-size:small\"><em>Thank you!&nbsp;</em></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"font-size:small\">&nbsp;</div>\n&nbsp;\n\n\n<div style=\"font-size:small\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><em><span><b>Sarah Greshowak</b></span></em></div>\n\n<div><em><span>Senior Designer</span></em></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><attachment id=\"2916b1c9-d931-4dbe-832e-b1ce0fb7454e\"></attachment><attachment id=\"7bd6f46e-5761-40df-a5f0-32ae643651d9\"></attachment>"
    },
