      }
    },
    "body": {
      "contentType": "html",
      "content": "<div>\n<div itemprop=\"copy-paste-block\">Hello - Starting a conversation in Teams for BALI / UBUD, <at id=\"0\">Dian</at>&nbsp;please see updated specs attached adding-\n\n<div style=\"font-size:small\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"font-size:small\">-Page 15- Barstool</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"font-size:small\">-Page 18- Nine Drawer Dresser</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"font-size:small\">-Page 19- Twelve Drawer Dresser</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"font-size:small\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"font-size:small\">Also Updated-&nbsp;</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"font-size:small\">Page 1- Edited height to 100mm (vs 102mm from before)</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"font-size:small\">Page 3- Edited height to 100mm (vs 102mm from before)</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"font-size:small\">Page 12- Sideboard- I noticed on latest tracker from Burree the Sideboard height was revised to 34\"H (vs 32\" H before)</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"font-size:small\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"font-size:small\">Also list of CADs needed for RH by Jan 04. Can you let us know if this is workable? Thank you!</div>\n\n\n</div>\n</div><attachment id=\"F8BD8758-BB44-4274-8863-5411C49E2EA5\"></attachment><attachment id=\"8f5bb9ad-385a-4d5b-902c-5ece25b2a9f4\"></attachment>"
