    "body": {
      "contentType": "html",
      "content": "<div>\n<div itemprop=\"copy-paste-block\">\n\n<div style=\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px\"><span><span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:auto\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span><span>Hello Dian, Felix, Paul-&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px\"><span><span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:auto\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px\"><span><span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:auto\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span><span>Here are specs for a new collection for you! It's called Bella. It's an indoor collection with chamfered edge detail. The chamfered edge shifts shape and form as it goes around the table edges.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px\"><span><span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:auto\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px\"><span><span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:auto\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span><span>We were thinking maybe this would be a good new collection to try out in Vietnam (Jonathan Charles) or any other vendors there.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px\"><span><span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:auto\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px\"><span><span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:auto\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span><span>Can you work on CADs for this, as well as work towards getting costing/sampling going? For the wood finish I just wrote Dark Brown Oak veneer, but could also consider other wood finishes.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px\"><span><span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:auto\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px\"><span><span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:auto\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span><span>Thank you!</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n&nbsp;\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px\"><span><span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:auto\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>\n\n\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><span><span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:auto\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span><span><span><span><b>Sarah Greshowak</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n\n\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><span><span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:auto\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span><span><span><span>Senior Designer</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n\n\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<div>\n\n<p><span><span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:auto\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span><span><font><strong><font>E:</font></strong></font><font><b>&nbsp;</b><a href=\"mailto:sarah@harbouroutdoor.com\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:sarah@harbouroutdoor.com\" style=\"color:rgb(104,136,201)\">sarah@harbouroutdoor.com</a></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n\n\n<p><span><span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:auto\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span><span><span><font><b>Harbour Outdoor | New York Office &amp; Showroom</b></font><br>\n\n<span>200 Lexington Ave, New York, NY, 10016&nbsp;</span><br>\n\n<span><b>O:&nbsp;</b></span><b><font>&nbsp;</font><font color=\"#6888c9\"><a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"tel:(646)%20692-4227\" value=\"+16466924227\" style=\"color:rgb(104,136,201)\">646 692 4227</a></font></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div><span><span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:auto\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span><span><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>\n\n\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n\n<p><span><span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:auto\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span><span><span><font><b>Harbour Outdoor | Los Angeles Office</b></font><br>\n\n<span>3240 Helms Ave, Los Angeles, CA, 90034</span><br>\n\n<span><b>O:&nbsp;</b></span><b><font color=\"#6888c9\"><a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"tel:(310)%20439-5972\" value=\"+13104395972\" style=\"color:rgb(104,136,201)\">310 439 5972</a></font></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><attachment id=\"caed1de9-7f3f-47f6-8d76-a9535dc777e5\"></attachment>"
