    "body": {
      "contentType": "html",
      "content": "<div>\n<div itemprop=\"copy-paste-block\">\n\n<div style=\"font-size:14px\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span style=\"font-size:small\"><span><span>Hi Dian,</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h2>\n\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span style=\"font-size:0.875rem\"><span><span style=\"font-size:small\"><span><span><span><span><span><span style=\"font-size:small\">Kira and I just reviewed the Victoria Teak photos now that we have received them in teams.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span style=\"font-size:0.875rem\"><span><span style=\"font-size:small\"><span><span><span><span><span><span style=\"font-size:small\">These samples do not look 100% there yet. While we can use this for photography for now, we need to fix these (RE: the comments in attached) for production.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span style=\"font-size:0.875rem\"><span><span style=\"font-size:small\"><span><span><span><span><span><span style=\"font-size:small\">How can we receive better quality samples going forward also? We waited a long time for these and some of the details are not very impressive. </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span style=\"font-size:0.875rem\"><span><span style=\"font-size:small\"><span><span><span><span><span><span style=\"font-size:small\">Please share back your feedback/corrective plan for production orders we have placed.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><attachment id=\"bd349238-f0a3-48f2-a075-3ecc2d87aa57\"></attachment>"
